WEBVTT

00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

00:00:17.472 --> 00:00:20.149
Why did you have to join
the Black Blood Gang?

00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:22.526
I joined the gang

00:00:23.653 --> 00:00:25.738
not to save myself.

00:00:27.823 --> 00:00:29.116
I joined them

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:31.202
to protect our friends...

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:34.455
Matt is one lucky guy

00:00:34.872 --> 00:00:36.666
to have a friend like you.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.627
I want to be as lucky as him one day.

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:43.296
Aren't you curious

00:00:43.297 --> 00:00:44.757
why Raze has been quiet lately?

00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:50.930
Why don't you ask him yourself?

00:00:51.681 --> 00:00:53.599
Stay away from Supremo

00:00:54.141 --> 00:00:55.267
or you die.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:00.898
I'm not going to let you or
Supremo's stupidity ruin everything!

00:01:02.191 --> 00:01:04.485
The night you and your friend got poisoned.

00:01:06.028 --> 00:01:07.530
I kept something from you.

00:01:08.155 --> 00:01:09.865
A student requested it from me.

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:18.207
A student you know well.

00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:22.085
Jerome

00:01:25.172 --> 00:01:26.424
where were you that time?

00:01:32.179 --> 00:01:32.680
Zein!

00:01:32.681 --> 00:01:34.180
You’re too much!

00:01:34.181 --> 00:01:36.892
Isn't it the perfect timing?

00:01:38.102 --> 00:01:41.105
You took the liquor and the ice

00:01:41.814 --> 00:01:42.982
and came back

00:01:43.065 --> 00:01:44.545
and all of the sudden we're poisoned?

00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:46.568
Am I right?

00:01:47.653 --> 00:01:48.863
But wait

00:01:49.905 --> 00:01:51.615
you weren't alone, were you?

00:01:52.575 --> 00:01:54.034
Someone was with you.

00:01:54.368 --> 00:01:55.411
Do you remember?

00:01:57.872 --> 00:01:59.498
Do any of you remember?

00:02:00.082 --> 00:02:01.709
What are you saying?

00:02:03.961 --> 00:02:05.004
Jerome

00:02:07.173 --> 00:02:08.758
where were you that night?

00:02:09.425 --> 00:02:10.426
What did you do?

00:02:10.551 --> 00:02:11.677
What are you saying, Zein?

00:02:11.844 --> 00:02:12.844
Do you remember?

00:02:14.513 --> 00:02:15.890
Where were you that night?

00:02:17.808 --> 00:02:18.976
What did you do?

00:02:30.237 --> 00:02:31.781
You don't want to talk?

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.369
You requested it, didn't you?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.164
Can you remember now?

00:02:40.706 --> 00:02:44.043
You requested the poison we ingested.

00:02:46.605 --> 00:02:47.564
Admit it!

00:02:47.589 --> 00:02:49.423
- You poisoned us!
- You're right!

00:02:50.471 --> 00:02:52.256
I placed the ice!

00:02:54.694 --> 00:02:56.569
I did that because she warned me

00:02:56.594 --> 00:02:58.513
that Madam Violet will harm you!

00:03:00.142 --> 00:03:01.142
Who's she?

00:03:02.186 --> 00:03:03.186
Huh?

00:03:03.437 --> 00:03:04.437
Who is it?

00:03:04.939 --> 00:03:06.857
Who told you, Jerome?

00:03:08.192 --> 00:03:09.192
The student

00:03:10.984 --> 00:03:12.235
with the red hood.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.466
The one who helped us in the clinic.

00:03:19.322 --> 00:03:21.157
To help Zein and Dave.

00:03:30.047 --> 00:03:32.382
She told me that Francisco
and Madam Violet

00:03:32.383 --> 00:03:34.881
were planning to poison Zein.

00:03:39.306 --> 00:03:41.517
We weren't sure how or when

00:03:42.017 --> 00:03:44.697
but we had a hunch that they'll
do it during the acquaintane party.

00:03:45.563 --> 00:03:47.439
We needed to act fast.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.193
I know it sounds crazy.

00:03:52.528 --> 00:03:54.738
But we needed to poison
Zein with a less fatal dose.

00:04:02.621 --> 00:04:04.874
That was the only way to save her

00:04:05.249 --> 00:04:07.459
without drawing suspicion
from Madam Violet.

00:04:24.226 --> 00:04:27.358
The only way to protect
her was to strike first.

00:04:30.274 --> 00:04:31.483
Where's the antidote?

00:04:33.986 --> 00:04:35.738
Please take care of her.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:54.214
I placed the poison inside the
ice to lessen the potency.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.468
But I didn't expect that she
would drink so much that night.

00:04:59.303 --> 00:05:00.554
Zein.

00:05:18.948 --> 00:05:21.742
Now, let her drink the antidote.

00:05:26.747 --> 00:05:29.816
I promise I didn't know
it would turn out that bad.

00:05:30.918 --> 00:05:32.336
Even Dave got poisoned.

00:05:33.462 --> 00:05:34.463
I'm sorry.

00:05:35.089 --> 00:05:36.089
Sorry, okay?

00:05:36.382 --> 00:05:37.382
Sorry.

00:05:38.954 --> 00:05:40.235
I screwed up, okay!

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.136
You're an asshole!

00:05:41.137 --> 00:05:42.220
Aren't we your friends?

00:05:42.221 --> 00:05:43.471
- Why didn't you tell us?
- Matt, enough!

00:05:43.472 --> 00:05:44.807
- Matt!
- Stop it!

00:05:44.808 --> 00:05:46.141
Matt, stop!

00:05:46.892 --> 00:05:47.892
Stop it, bro.

00:05:48.143 --> 00:05:48.994
Matt!

00:05:49.019 --> 00:05:50.019
Asshole.

00:05:51.563 --> 00:05:53.189
You should be the
one to understand

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:56.068
if Jerome had a secret
he was protecting.

00:05:57.042 --> 00:05:58.042
So...

00:05:58.788 --> 00:05:59.998
I wasn't the target.

00:06:14.128 --> 00:06:15.128
The bottle

00:06:16.422 --> 00:06:17.662
someone tossed it to us, right?

00:06:20.509 --> 00:06:21.509
The girl.

00:06:25.723 --> 00:06:26.723
Is that so...

00:06:28.434 --> 00:06:29.434
we have someone on our side

00:06:29.435 --> 00:06:30.978
we know nothing about.

00:07:00.382 --> 00:07:02.760
Incineration protocol.

00:09:56.517 --> 00:09:57.601
Can I sit here?

00:10:01.104 --> 00:10:02.981
So much for asking.

00:10:05.025 --> 00:10:07.110
You really don't know
how to be afraid, do you?

00:10:08.487 --> 00:10:10.405
Why should I be afraid of you, Frtizy?

00:10:11.406 --> 00:10:12.741
As expected

00:10:13.158 --> 00:10:15.869
from a secretary spoiled by Supremo.

00:10:17.537 --> 00:10:19.748
What the hell do you want, Fritzy?

00:10:20.975 --> 00:10:23.310
There a few things I want to clarify.

00:10:23.335 --> 00:10:24.335
Please.

00:10:24.753 --> 00:10:26.880
I don't have time for your nonsense.

00:10:29.132 --> 00:10:30.801
Even if it's for Supremo's sake?

00:10:35.764 --> 00:10:37.891
What do you really want to say, Frtizy?

00:10:38.433 --> 00:10:39.433
Look...

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.980
I was a bitch to you before
because I was testing you.

00:10:43.897 --> 00:10:45.816
But believe it or not

00:10:46.358 --> 00:10:48.527
we want the same thing.

00:10:49.444 --> 00:10:51.655
And that's protecting Supremo.

00:10:54.116 --> 00:10:56.118
How do I know if I could trust you?

00:10:56.827 --> 00:10:58.869
I believe that he's the only hope

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.789
for all of us to escape this place.

00:11:02.499 --> 00:11:03.499
Yes.

00:11:04.543 --> 00:11:06.253
I know I was a bitch to you sometimes.

00:11:06.628 --> 00:11:07.628
Sometimes?

00:11:08.588 --> 00:11:11.133
But I also want to get
out of this hellhole.

00:11:12.384 --> 00:11:13.384
So...

00:11:15.012 --> 00:11:16.430
let's work together.

00:11:23.895 --> 00:11:24.895
Fine.

00:11:26.064 --> 00:11:30.694
But you need to respect
my position as SSG Secretary.

00:11:31.945 --> 00:11:33.488
Enough with you bullshit.

00:11:36.616 --> 00:11:37.616
Fine.

00:11:37.743 --> 00:11:41.330
Just make sure that you'll use
your position to your advantage.

00:11:42.122 --> 00:11:43.122
Of course.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.125
But just so you know

00:11:45.792 --> 00:11:47.502
this doesn't mean that we're friends.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.465
We just have a deal.

00:11:52.341 --> 00:11:53.341
Deal!

00:11:55.469 --> 00:11:56.469
Lunch?

00:12:12.986 --> 00:12:14.237
There's a policy here

00:12:15.238 --> 00:12:17.032
gorgeous first.

00:12:17.366 --> 00:12:18.366
So...

00:12:18.992 --> 00:12:20.410
wait behind me.

00:12:26.458 --> 00:12:27.709
Remember

00:12:28.126 --> 00:12:31.046
we're not supposed to
be seen as friends.

00:12:31.421 --> 00:12:32.631
Chill.

00:12:32.881 --> 00:12:34.674
I'm just getting a drink.

00:12:35.509 --> 00:12:36.843
I'm not planning to stay.

00:12:37.511 --> 00:12:38.511
Duh!

00:12:53.235 --> 00:12:54.235
A queen?

00:12:55.862 --> 00:12:58.280
I have a feeling that my bag will fall

00:12:58.281 --> 00:13:00.283
and will leave a mess on the floor.

00:13:08.458 --> 00:13:09.918
I knew it!

00:13:10.419 --> 00:13:12.796
My intuition is so strong, isn't it?

00:13:13.463 --> 00:13:14.798
Pick it up for me.

00:13:19.511 --> 00:13:20.511
Zein.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.016
This makes me so happy.

00:13:25.308 --> 00:13:27.644
My slaves instantly multiplied!

00:13:28.562 --> 00:13:30.021
As they should

00:13:30.397 --> 00:13:32.649
I'm the queen of this school anyway.

00:13:40.365 --> 00:13:43.368
I'm feeling something else coming.

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:44.536
Wow.

00:13:44.661 --> 00:13:45.787
Don't you feel

00:13:46.371 --> 00:13:47.913
that a hand is going to smack

00:13:47.914 --> 00:13:51.543
that foundation filled face of yours?

00:13:52.919 --> 00:13:56.298
I see where Zein gets her audacity from.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.758
And you are?

00:13:59.217 --> 00:13:59.634
Oh

00:14:00.093 --> 00:14:01.678
You don’t have to know me.

00:14:02.345 --> 00:14:04.848
And I don’t care about you anyway.

00:14:05.098 --> 00:14:06.414
How dare you...

00:14:08.143 --> 00:14:08.994
Oops.

00:14:09.019 --> 00:14:10.019
Sorry.

00:14:10.228 --> 00:14:11.313
I couldn't help it.

00:14:13.064 --> 00:14:14.107
Let's go, Zein.

00:14:18.069 --> 00:14:19.154
Get out of the way!

00:14:19.821 --> 00:14:20.989
Move!

00:14:23.533 --> 00:14:24.533
Deserve.

00:14:24.785 --> 00:14:26.281
Nice one, Mia.

00:14:26.762 --> 00:14:30.432
We should've slapped
her on each cheek.

00:14:30.558 --> 00:14:31.951
You take the left and

00:14:31.976 --> 00:14:33.227
I'll take the right.

00:14:33.376 --> 00:14:34.961
At least you landed one on her.

00:14:35.045 --> 00:14:37.047
Way to show her you
can't be bossed around.

00:14:37.172 --> 00:14:38.881
But I think I slapped her too hard.

00:14:38.882 --> 00:14:40.050
She deserved it!

00:14:40.675 --> 00:14:42.469
What if she takes revenge
on you, Mia?

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.931
And does more something worse?

00:14:46.932 --> 00:14:48.475
Then I'll slap her again.

00:14:49.184 --> 00:14:50.519
On the other side of her cheek.

00:14:50.602 --> 00:14:51.453
To even it out.

00:14:51.478 --> 00:14:52.020
Mia.

00:14:52.021 --> 00:14:53.355
Mia's gotten a lot braver.

00:14:54.356 --> 00:14:55.982
Don't worry about me, Zein.

00:14:56.691 --> 00:14:58.151
I can handle myself.

00:14:58.922 --> 00:15:00.841
Mia has grown so much.

00:15:01.154 --> 00:15:03.990
Version 2.0!

00:15:04.157 --> 00:15:05.408
- Yeah!
- Stop it.

00:15:05.492 --> 00:15:06.492
Nice one, Mia.

00:15:09.329 --> 00:15:10.329
May I sit?

00:15:10.664 --> 00:15:11.664
Let's go, guys.

00:15:11.789 --> 00:15:12.582
Let's go?

00:15:12.582 --> 00:15:13.565
We still have class.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:14.870
- Right? Class?
- Yeah, let's go.

00:15:15.054 --> 00:15:16.453
- Oh right class.
- Class.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.713
We don't want to be late so.

00:15:18.755 --> 00:15:20.130
We’ll go now, Zein. Bye bye.

00:15:20.131 --> 00:15:21.007
Bye, Zein!

00:15:21.008 --> 00:15:22.092
How about you, Angelica?

00:15:22.175 --> 00:15:24.052
Do you want to walk with us?

00:15:26.179 --> 00:15:27.680
Come on! Give me your bag.

00:15:27.681 --> 00:15:28.682
Let's go.

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.161
You're still not eating enough?

00:15:53.081 --> 00:15:54.457
What do you call this?

00:15:56.835 --> 00:15:57.836
It's food, isn't it?

00:15:59.129 --> 00:16:00.130
That's food?

00:16:00.797 --> 00:16:01.797
Obviously.

00:16:02.048 --> 00:16:03.048
You should try it.

00:16:04.259 --> 00:16:05.635
Am I an animal?

00:16:06.595 --> 00:16:08.430
You don't eat vegetables?

00:16:13.059 --> 00:16:14.394
You're going to make me eat

00:16:14.769 --> 00:16:16.062
bermuda grass?

00:16:16.688 --> 00:16:17.688
And

00:16:18.815 --> 00:16:19.815
what is this?

00:16:19.983 --> 00:16:21.109
Bitter melon.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.403
That sounds bad.

00:16:24.321 --> 00:16:26.406
Stop acting like a spoiled kid.

00:16:26.615 --> 00:16:27.591
What?

00:16:27.616 --> 00:16:28.635
No, I'm not.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:31.162
Grown men eat vegetables.

00:16:32.675 --> 00:16:35.219
And what is your scientific
explanation for that?

00:16:36.541 --> 00:16:38.293
Scientific explanation, really?

00:16:38.568 --> 00:16:39.694
Just try it!

00:16:42.236 --> 00:16:45.156
You're not going to get
full if you just stare at me

00:16:45.553 --> 00:16:46.721
or my food.

00:16:49.679 --> 00:16:50.679
But I feel like

00:16:51.431 --> 00:16:52.599
your gaze is enough

00:16:53.224 --> 00:16:54.517
to keep me full.

00:16:59.898 --> 00:17:01.024
Are you going to eat

00:17:01.358 --> 00:17:02.567
or should I feed you?

00:17:05.362 --> 00:17:06.362
Why not?

00:17:07.155 --> 00:17:08.782
I'm a spoiled kid after all.

00:17:10.408 --> 00:17:11.409
You wish.

00:17:12.327 --> 00:17:13.662
Just try it.

00:17:14.579 --> 00:17:15.579
Come on.

00:17:17.916 --> 00:17:19.417
I got my hope's up in you feeding me.

00:17:21.378 --> 00:17:22.879
Are you going to eat

00:17:23.838 --> 00:17:25.215
or else...

00:17:25.507 --> 00:17:26.507
Or else what?

00:17:59.708 --> 00:18:00.708
Zein.

00:18:02.585 --> 00:18:03.585
Zein?

00:18:06.589 --> 00:18:08.425
It's so good.

00:18:09.718 --> 00:18:10.719
You should try it.

00:18:14.723 --> 00:18:15.723
Come on.

00:18:17.225 --> 00:18:18.476
Bitter melon.

00:18:19.894 --> 00:18:20.895
It's yummy!

00:18:34.826 --> 00:18:35.826
This tastes horrible.

00:18:35.827 --> 00:18:36.953
Don't spit it out!

00:18:39.748 --> 00:18:40.748
Very good.

00:18:41.916 --> 00:18:42.916
Try this one.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:46.212
You already know what this is called.

00:18:47.839 --> 00:18:48.839
- What is it?
- Spinach.

00:18:50.133 --> 00:18:51.133
Correct.

00:18:51.468 --> 00:18:52.468
Try it.

00:18:53.178 --> 00:18:54.512
I don't eat spinach.

00:18:55.722 --> 00:18:56.805
Just try it.

00:18:56.806 --> 00:18:57.807
One bite.

00:18:58.391 --> 00:18:59.391
Promise

00:18:59.434 --> 00:19:00.434
it's not bitter.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.020
Try it.

00:19:24.417 --> 00:19:25.417
Oh?

00:19:28.379 --> 00:19:29.379
Ace...

00:19:29.422 --> 00:19:30.422
Huh?

00:19:30.965 --> 00:19:31.965
Are you okay?

00:19:34.761 --> 00:19:35.761
Supremo

00:19:37.347 --> 00:19:38.389
are you okay?

00:19:40.892 --> 00:19:41.976
Thank you for the lunch.

00:19:42.727 --> 00:19:43.727
Zein.

00:19:43.853 --> 00:19:44.896
Are you...

00:19:45.355 --> 00:19:46.856
allergic to spinach?

00:19:47.232 --> 00:19:48.775
Why didn't you tell me!

00:19:49.317 --> 00:19:50.276
Supremo.

00:19:50.276 --> 00:19:51.276
It's okay.

00:19:52.153 --> 00:19:53.153
Zein

00:19:54.489 --> 00:19:55.532
it tastes good.

00:19:57.283 --> 00:19:58.284
Just like what you said.

00:20:02.622 --> 00:20:03.665
Supremo...

00:20:03.998 --> 00:20:04.998
I could never

00:20:06.501 --> 00:20:07.794
waste your efforts.

00:20:11.673 --> 00:20:14.717
Even if my body refuses.

00:20:17.262 --> 00:20:18.262
Please...

00:20:18.388 --> 00:20:19.388
please!

00:20:19.597 --> 00:20:20.598
Please drink!

00:20:21.099 --> 00:20:22.099
Help!

00:20:23.101 --> 00:20:24.101
Help us!

00:20:24.602 --> 00:20:25.770
Please!

00:20:27.021 --> 00:20:28.105
Please!

00:20:28.106 --> 00:20:28.606
- Help us!
- What happened?

00:20:28.606 --> 00:20:29.274
Supremo...

00:20:29.524 --> 00:20:30.524
Help!

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:34.090
Let's take him to the clinic, please!

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:36.573
Supremo, please!

00:20:36.865 --> 00:20:38.241
Please, help us!

00:20:42.829 --> 00:20:44.122
Please help us!

00:20:44.289 --> 00:20:45.123
Nurse Cha, please!

00:20:45.123 --> 00:20:46.363
- What happened?
- It's Supremo.

00:20:46.541 --> 00:20:47.709
He...

00:20:48.626 --> 00:20:51.421
He ate spinach and had
a sudden allergic reaction.

00:20:52.714 --> 00:20:53.714
Let him lie down.

00:20:54.674 --> 00:20:55.674
Now!

00:20:59.178 --> 00:21:00.178
Is he...

00:21:00.221 --> 00:21:01.221
Is he.

00:21:01.306 --> 00:21:02.306
Is he going to.

00:21:02.765 --> 00:21:03.765
To live?

00:21:04.017 --> 00:21:05.101
Of course he is!

00:21:06.477 --> 00:21:07.729
You're going to be okay.

00:21:27.332 --> 00:21:28.332
He's stable now.

00:21:28.583 --> 00:21:30.460
He needs further observation.

00:21:33.213 --> 00:21:34.213
Stupid!

00:21:34.505 --> 00:21:36.215
You put Supremo in danger!

00:21:36.341 --> 00:21:36.841
I didn't mean to.

00:21:36.841 --> 00:21:37.775
You're such an idiot!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:38.568
Stupid!

00:21:38.593 --> 00:21:39.569
Can't you do anything right?

00:21:39.594 --> 00:21:40.361
Idiot!

00:21:40.386 --> 00:21:41.279
Stop it!

00:21:41.304 --> 00:21:42.304
Angel!

00:21:43.014 --> 00:21:46.851
You wouldn’t like it if Supremo
knew you slapped his secretary!

00:21:48.478 --> 00:21:51.105
I'm sure Supremo will punish
her personally when he wakes up.

00:21:52.607 --> 00:21:54.067
She's lucky if he doesn't kill her.

00:21:55.193 --> 00:21:56.402
Are you making us laugh?

00:21:56.694 --> 00:21:57.820
Do you really think.

00:21:58.196 --> 00:22:00.156
Supremo can hurt her?

00:22:01.366 --> 00:22:02.951
I think it's you who should be nervous.

00:22:05.161 --> 00:22:07.205
If Supremo doesn't want to punish her.

00:22:09.999 --> 00:22:10.999
I will.

00:22:11.584 --> 00:22:13.264
I'll make sure she gets what she deserves.

00:22:17.465 --> 00:22:18.465
Don't worry about her.

00:22:19.092 --> 00:22:20.510
You didn't mean to hurt him.

00:22:21.219 --> 00:22:22.679
This is negligence, Zein!

00:22:23.221 --> 00:22:25.056
You endangered the council!

00:22:25.306 --> 00:22:26.891
How could you be so careless!

00:22:27.433 --> 00:22:29.184
Ms. Kath, I didn't mean to.

00:22:29.185 --> 00:22:30.185
Still!

00:22:30.436 --> 00:22:31.520
You were so careless!

00:22:31.521 --> 00:22:33.121
Can you use that brain
of yours for once!

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:35.440
Ms. Kath

00:22:36.067 --> 00:22:37.735
can we all be just calm?

00:22:37.819 --> 00:22:38.903
This is not the time

00:22:39.904 --> 00:22:40.904
to point fingers.

00:22:42.407 --> 00:22:44.158
Let's just have Supremo
take a rest, please.

00:23:25.533 --> 00:23:26.659
We heard what happened.

00:23:27.176 --> 00:23:28.369
How is Supremo?

00:23:30.705 --> 00:23:32.373
He’s still unconscious.

00:23:33.332 --> 00:23:34.332
How about you?

00:23:34.375 --> 00:23:35.710
Are you okay?

00:23:39.797 --> 00:23:41.174
It's my fault.

00:23:42.383 --> 00:23:45.053
If I didn't push him to eat vegetables

00:23:45.803 --> 00:23:47.138
this would have not happened.

00:23:49.057 --> 00:23:52.143
You didn't know he
was allergic to spinach.

00:23:52.979 --> 00:23:54.188
It was an accident.

00:23:54.905 --> 00:23:55.948
Mia's right.

00:23:56.856 --> 00:23:58.691
Don't be too hard on yourself.

00:23:59.358 --> 00:24:00.777
Supremo will be okay.

00:24:05.031 --> 00:24:05.965
You!

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:07.158
Venomancer!

00:24:07.450 --> 00:24:09.452
You need to pay for
what you did to Supremo.

00:24:13.831 --> 00:24:15.239
What's happening here?

00:24:15.971 --> 00:24:18.932
This is no longer your business,
ex-secretary.

00:24:19.967 --> 00:24:21.677
Are you stirring up trouble again?

00:24:22.048 --> 00:24:24.841
Our Supremo is unconscious
because of this girl.

00:24:24.842 --> 00:24:26.385
He almost died!

00:24:27.595 --> 00:24:28.595
What?

00:24:28.679 --> 00:24:29.847
I didn't mean to.

00:24:31.766 --> 00:24:32.767
Don't play dumb.

00:24:33.309 --> 00:24:34.567
You did it on purpose!

00:24:34.811 --> 00:24:35.811
No!

00:24:36.145 --> 00:24:37.855
I can never hurt Supremo!

00:24:38.314 --> 00:24:39.314
Really?

00:24:40.070 --> 00:24:41.989
We see right through you!

00:24:44.654 --> 00:24:47.406
Are you going to allow
this girl to kill our Supremo?

00:24:47.615 --> 00:24:49.700
No!

00:24:52.411 --> 00:24:54.121
What should we do to her?

00:24:54.122 --> 00:24:55.789
Tie her up and punish her!

00:24:55.790 --> 00:24:57.124
Right!

00:24:57.125 --> 00:24:58.668
Tie her up!

00:24:59.544 --> 00:25:01.087
- Zein!
- Don't you dare touch her!

00:25:01.212 --> 00:25:02.337
She didn't do it on purpose!

00:25:02.338 --> 00:25:03.172
Stop it, guys!

00:25:03.172 --> 00:25:04.382
- Let go of me!
- No!

00:25:04.382 --> 00:25:05.091
Get over here!

00:25:05.091 --> 00:25:06.025
Stop!

00:25:06.050 --> 00:25:07.218
Stop resisting!

00:25:08.469 --> 00:25:09.762
Let her go.

00:25:11.973 --> 00:25:12.973
Zein!

00:25:13.224 --> 00:25:14.224
Zein!

00:25:14.267 --> 00:25:15.893
- Zein!
- Let her go, please!

00:25:16.602 --> 00:25:17.979
- No! Zein!
- Zein!

00:25:19.147 --> 00:25:20.147
- Zein!

00:25:26.028 --> 00:25:27.113
Hit her again!

00:25:28.072 --> 00:25:29.447
Let me go!

00:25:29.448 --> 00:25:30.908
- No!
- Zein!

00:25:36.289 --> 00:25:37.289
Zein!

00:25:37.665 --> 00:25:38.665
Zein!

00:25:42.712 --> 00:25:44.255
Hold her and don't let her go!

00:25:55.600 --> 00:25:56.642
No! Zein!

00:25:56.809 --> 00:25:57.809
Zein!

00:26:00.855 --> 00:26:01.789
Your turn.

00:26:01.814 --> 00:26:02.814
Zein!

00:26:04.066 --> 00:26:05.234
Haven't we had enough?

00:26:06.736 --> 00:26:08.029
Are you serious, Roxane?

00:26:08.863 --> 00:26:10.239
She needs to be punished!

00:26:10.406 --> 00:26:12.200
Just think of what she did to Supremo.

00:26:12.742 --> 00:26:14.118
She deserves this!

00:26:16.746 --> 00:26:17.746
Go!

00:26:18.748 --> 00:26:19.748
More!

00:26:20.082 --> 00:26:20.750
More!

00:26:20.750 --> 00:26:21.392
Zein!

00:26:21.417 --> 00:26:22.501
Stop it!

00:26:23.127 --> 00:26:24.127
Zein!

00:26:24.503 --> 00:26:25.503
More!

00:26:28.424 --> 00:26:29.424
Give me that!

00:26:29.842 --> 00:26:30.842
You're too weak!

00:26:32.929 --> 00:26:34.472
Angelica, stop this!

00:26:34.764 --> 00:26:35.973
She's had enough!

00:26:36.766 --> 00:26:38.016
Angelica, stop it!

00:26:38.017 --> 00:26:39.227
Angelica!

00:26:40.895 --> 00:26:42.230
Stop it!

00:26:58.246 --> 00:27:00.581
That's what you get
for hurting Supremo!

00:27:01.958 --> 00:27:03.292
Should I continue?

00:27:03.417 --> 00:27:04.793
- Yes!
- Zein!

00:27:04.794 --> 00:27:05.794
Zein!

00:27:06.128 --> 00:27:07.588
Stop i! Zein!

00:27:10.383 --> 00:27:11.383
Angelica!

00:27:13.094 --> 00:27:14.262
Angelica!

00:27:14.679 --> 00:27:15.763
Stop!

00:27:16.389 --> 00:27:17.390
Please, stop it!

00:27:23.437 --> 00:27:25.481
Zein!

00:27:25.898 --> 00:27:27.108
What should we do?

00:27:27.692 --> 00:27:28.459
Zein!

00:27:28.484 --> 00:27:29.484
Zein!

00:27:30.820 --> 00:27:32.321
Goodbye, Zein Shion.

00:27:34.782 --> 00:27:36.534
Zein!

00:27:49.338 --> 00:27:50.715
What do you think you're doing?

00:27:51.590 --> 00:27:52.590
Untie her!

00:27:58.180 --> 00:27:59.180
All of you!

00:28:00.182 --> 00:28:02.143
Take my command!

00:28:03.284 --> 00:28:05.661
Nobody leaves this hall.

00:28:07.857 --> 00:28:09.607
This is an order

00:28:09.608 --> 00:28:11.902
from the highest Supreme
Student Government President.

00:28:12.653 --> 00:28:13.654
Understood?

00:28:20.411 --> 00:28:21.412
Let go!

00:28:23.414 --> 00:28:24.414
Zein.

00:28:30.963 --> 00:28:31.963
Zein...

00:28:51.776 --> 00:28:53.110
Hang in there, Zein.

00:28:55.154 --> 00:28:57.656
Nurse, what's her blood type?

00:28:57.823 --> 00:28:58.823
I don't know.

00:29:06.741 --> 00:29:09.035
Extracting blood sample.

00:29:41.867 --> 00:29:42.867
Guys...

00:29:43.786 --> 00:29:45.329
we heard what happened.

00:29:45.496 --> 00:29:46.580
Are you okay?

00:29:48.582 --> 00:29:49.875
We're okay

00:29:50.751 --> 00:29:52.253
but Zein isn't.

00:29:52.878 --> 00:29:54.255
How did it come to that?

00:29:54.630 --> 00:29:55.840
Why didn't she fight back?

00:29:56.382 --> 00:29:57.842
I think she has a reason.

00:29:58.259 --> 00:30:01.762
But right now let's just
hope she'll be okay.

00:30:02.722 --> 00:30:03.848
She’ll be okay.

00:30:04.223 --> 00:30:05.850
She's with Supremo.

00:30:06.851 --> 00:30:08.769
Can't we go to her?

00:30:09.437 --> 00:30:10.980
She needs us.

00:30:11.147 --> 00:30:12.273
We can't leave.

00:30:12.773 --> 00:30:14.275
We can't disobey Supremo's command.

00:30:15.860 --> 00:30:16.986
Let's just wait.

00:30:17.695 --> 00:30:18.695
Fine.

00:30:53.564 --> 00:30:54.607
I promise you.

00:30:58.277 --> 00:31:00.946
They will pay for what they did.

00:31:28.891 --> 00:31:30.809
You are such a disappointment.

00:31:31.602 --> 00:31:34.438
This is your last chance, Supremo!

00:31:35.064 --> 00:31:36.064
Do what you want.

00:31:37.233 --> 00:31:38.858
I found the source of my happiness

00:31:38.859 --> 00:31:40.569
and I'm not going to let it go.

00:31:41.612 --> 00:31:43.572
You're exacty like Lux.

00:31:45.324 --> 00:31:46.450
Fragile.

00:31:46.992 --> 00:31:47.992
Weak.

00:31:49.064 --> 00:31:51.275
I'm not Lux.

00:31:53.123 --> 00:31:54.416
Are you sure?

00:31:55.584 --> 00:31:56.584
Unlike him.

00:31:57.795 --> 00:31:58.921
I'm watching my back.

00:32:02.466 --> 00:32:03.968
Let's see about that.

00:32:05.052 --> 00:32:06.052
Do you think

00:32:07.137 --> 00:32:08.764
I'll let you repeat what
you did before?

00:32:09.598 --> 00:32:10.891
You're dead wrong.

00:32:12.518 --> 00:32:14.019
Try to touch Zein

00:32:15.271 --> 00:32:18.148
and you'll feel what
the real hell is like.

00:32:19.692 --> 00:32:21.068
Are you trying to scare me?

00:32:22.319 --> 00:32:23.319
No.

00:32:24.154 --> 00:32:26.073
But if you're planning to hurt her

00:32:27.658 --> 00:32:29.034
you should be afraid.

00:32:32.329 --> 00:32:33.455
If you say so.

00:32:46.218 --> 00:32:46.969
What the fuck, Roxane.

00:32:46.970 --> 00:32:49.090
- We need to avenge Zein.
- What are you so afraid of?

00:32:49.847 --> 00:32:51.167
- I wonder.
- Aren't you the queen?

00:32:51.307 --> 00:32:52.307
How is she?

00:32:52.558 --> 00:32:53.725
- She won't stop so we need...

00:32:53.726 --> 00:32:55.366
- to finish this.
- She's gonna be fine.

00:32:55.519 --> 00:32:57.020
As long as she's with Supremo

00:32:57.021 --> 00:32:58.230
she'll be taken care of.

00:32:58.856 --> 00:32:59.981
Stop it!

00:32:59.982 --> 00:33:01.233
I'm done with you.

00:33:02.234 --> 00:33:03.736
Watch your words, Roxane.

00:33:04.069 --> 00:33:05.069
Why?

00:33:05.112 --> 00:33:06.864
Isn't this your plan?

00:33:07.448 --> 00:33:08.073
Right?

00:33:08.365 --> 00:33:09.490
You want Zein dead

00:33:09.491 --> 00:33:11.091
so you can have
Supremo all for yourself!

00:33:13.037 --> 00:33:14.121
How dare you?

00:33:14.288 --> 00:33:15.539
I’m the Queen here!

00:33:21.211 --> 00:33:22.379
You bitch.

00:33:25.466 --> 00:33:26.800
You think you can fight me?

00:33:33.098 --> 00:33:34.308
You bitch!

00:33:34.767 --> 00:33:36.185
Really? You're done with me?

00:33:37.186 --> 00:33:38.646
No one's going to stop me.

00:33:38.854 --> 00:33:39.980
You bitch!

00:33:45.819 --> 00:33:47.529
The BBG...

00:33:51.367 --> 00:33:52.868
It's about time they stop fighting.

00:34:06.840 --> 00:34:08.384
Why did you anger him?

00:34:15.432 --> 00:34:17.685
If you only saw how
angry Supremo was earlier

00:34:18.268 --> 00:34:19.770
you should be afraid.

00:34:23.899 --> 00:34:25.359
It's Raze...

00:34:26.568 --> 00:34:27.568
What the...

00:34:27.736 --> 00:34:29.029
Devil God Warrior?

00:34:31.699 --> 00:34:32.699
Raze.

00:34:33.492 --> 00:34:34.492
Please Raze.

00:34:35.536 --> 00:34:36.536
You have to help me.

00:34:36.662 --> 00:34:37.392
Please.

00:34:37.417 --> 00:34:38.417
Sorry...

00:34:38.580 --> 00:34:40.666
but I can't do anything about this.

00:34:41.509 --> 00:34:42.509
What?

00:34:44.753 --> 00:34:45.753
Huh?

00:34:47.297 --> 00:34:48.297
Supremo?

00:34:50.217 --> 00:34:51.217
Get back.

00:34:55.222 --> 00:34:56.222
Supremo...

00:34:57.474 --> 00:34:58.225
I'm sorry.

00:34:58.226 --> 00:34:59.852
I won't do it again.

00:35:00.227 --> 00:35:01.854
Forgive me, please.

00:35:02.229 --> 00:35:02.896
Supremo.

00:35:02.897 --> 00:35:04.523
I am not asking you to apologize.

00:35:04.690 --> 00:35:05.566
Forgive me, please.

00:35:05.649 --> 00:35:07.818
I just want you to pay
for the consequences.

00:35:08.610 --> 00:35:09.819
Consequences?

00:35:09.820 --> 00:35:11.029
Or you're just angry

00:35:11.030 --> 00:35:13.365
because your favorite
secretary got hurt?

00:35:16.910 --> 00:35:17.910
Huh?

00:35:18.245 --> 00:35:20.873
I'm Supremo's favorite secretary.

00:35:21.331 --> 00:35:22.331
Don't butt it.

00:35:22.624 --> 00:35:24.376
Supremo never had your back.

00:35:26.545 --> 00:35:30.340
Every student involved in
the commotion eariler

00:35:31.383 --> 00:35:32.760
step to the front!

00:35:33.385 --> 00:35:35.095
Who are you to do this to us?

00:35:35.429 --> 00:35:37.181
I am the Queen here!

00:35:38.474 --> 00:35:41.810
Not anymore!

00:35:43.270 --> 00:35:44.354
What the fuck.

00:35:45.230 --> 00:35:46.230
What is he doing?

00:35:48.901 --> 00:35:50.693
Who'll be the next queen?

00:35:50.694 --> 00:35:51.694
Huh?

00:35:51.987 --> 00:35:52.987
Queen?

00:37:23.912 --> 00:37:25.122
Starting today

00:37:25.998 --> 00:37:28.083
there will be no queen from DGW!

00:37:29.543 --> 00:37:32.337
I am giving the
crown to Zein Shion.

00:37:32.379 --> 00:37:33.379
To Zein?

00:37:33.380 --> 00:37:34.797
As the new queen of Hell University.

00:37:34.798 --> 00:37:35.798
Zein?

00:37:40.596 --> 00:37:41.889
Really?

00:37:42.389 --> 00:37:44.558
Zein is the new queen
of Hell University?

00:37:44.933 --> 00:37:46.226
You can’t do that!

00:37:47.144 --> 00:37:48.145
Of course I can!

00:37:55.611 --> 00:37:57.237
And I also declare

00:37:57.571 --> 00:37:58.614
Matthew Hart

00:37:59.323 --> 00:38:02.451
as the new King of Hell University.

00:38:05.370 --> 00:38:06.370
Matt?

00:38:07.623 --> 00:38:10.751
SUBS TO FOLOW ONCE ADR IS PLACED

00:38:15.380 --> 00:38:18.175
And I have the newest
list of the Highest Ten.

00:38:19.551 --> 00:38:20.551
Vice Onel!

00:38:30.103 --> 00:38:31.103
Top 1:

00:38:31.939 --> 00:38:33.315
Supremo, Ace Craige.

00:38:36.526 --> 00:38:37.235
Oh my god.

00:38:37.236 --> 00:38:41.406
The leaders of Devil God Warrior
and Black Blood Gang bowed down to him.

00:38:42.366 --> 00:38:43.992
Is Supremo really that powerful?

00:38:45.452 --> 00:38:46.452
Top 2:

00:38:47.204 --> 00:38:48.372
Raze Silvenia.

00:38:49.748 --> 00:38:50.748
Top 3:

00:38:51.541 --> 00:38:52.584
Nazzer Lumia.

00:38:53.961 --> 00:38:54.961
Top 4:

00:38:56.630 --> 00:38:58.090
Zein Shion.

00:38:58.590 --> 00:39:00.550
SUBS TO FOLLOW ONCE ADR IS PLACED

00:39:01.760 --> 00:39:02.760
Zein?

00:39:08.934 --> 00:39:09.934
Top 5:

00:39:11.019 --> 00:39:12.019
Onel Ty.

00:39:14.106 --> 00:39:15.107
Top 6:

00:39:15.649 --> 00:39:16.650
Liam Rivera.

00:39:17.901 --> 00:39:20.737
SUBS TO FOLLOW ONCE ADR IS PLACED

00:39:23.448 --> 00:39:24.449
Top 7:

00:39:25.242 --> 00:39:26.284
Matthew Hart

00:39:27.119 --> 00:39:28.161
Matthew?

00:39:28.286 --> 00:39:29.286
You're in, bro!

00:39:31.540 --> 00:39:32.540
I hope we get in too.

00:39:37.295 --> 00:39:38.295
Top 8:

00:39:38.922 --> 00:39:40.048
Fritzy Saldivar.

00:39:44.553 --> 00:39:46.847
I will devote myself to Zein Shion.

00:39:47.597 --> 00:39:48.598
Imagine

00:39:49.057 --> 00:39:50.266
she's still a newbie

00:39:50.267 --> 00:39:52.644
she immediately
got into the ranks.

00:39:53.228 --> 00:39:54.479
And on top of all that.

00:39:55.022 --> 00:39:57.315
She's even the
queen of Hell University.

00:39:58.859 --> 00:39:59.859
Top 9:

00:40:00.485 --> 00:40:01.485
Nicky Colt.

00:40:03.655 --> 00:40:05.032
Good job.

00:40:07.743 --> 00:40:08.743
Top 10:

00:40:09.453 --> 00:40:10.620
Jerome Marquez

00:40:11.539 --> 00:40:12.039
Jerome?

00:40:12.039 --> 00:40:13.039
Me?

00:40:13.165 --> 00:40:14.165
Jerome, it's you.

00:40:14.374 --> 00:40:15.374
Nice one, bro.

00:40:15.417 --> 00:40:16.084
Congrats!

00:40:16.085 --> 00:40:17.461
Let's go!

00:40:18.920 --> 00:40:19.921
Proud of you.

00:40:27.971 --> 00:40:29.181
Thank you, Vice Onel.

00:40:33.602 --> 00:40:34.602
Now...

00:40:35.270 --> 00:40:36.270
Listen,

00:40:36.772 --> 00:40:39.566
Black Blood Gang and Devil God Warrior.

00:40:40.275 --> 00:40:41.944
Memorize these faces!

00:40:43.474 --> 00:40:44.474
Next week

00:40:44.851 --> 00:40:46.060
they’ll be your target.

00:40:46.790 --> 00:40:49.297
And I don't care if you do it

00:40:49.322 --> 00:40:51.616
during the morning or during Bloody Night.

00:40:53.407 --> 00:40:55.242
You're not allowed to target anyone else

00:40:55.727 --> 00:40:57.287
besides the faces you see in this room.

00:40:58.981 --> 00:41:00.065
Do as you please.

00:41:00.941 --> 00:41:02.341
If you want to kill them, go ahead.

00:41:02.937 --> 00:41:04.337
If you want to kill them, go ahead.

00:41:07.447 --> 00:41:08.447
Happy hunting!

00:41:10.427 --> 00:41:12.721
This is your punishment

00:41:14.538 --> 00:41:16.415
and this is an order

00:41:17.082 --> 00:41:19.668
from the highest Supreme
Student Government.

00:41:20.963 --> 00:41:21.963
Dismissed!

00:41:45.068 --> 00:41:46.194
Nazzer!

00:41:46.195 --> 00:41:47.195
What's your problem?

00:41:47.529 --> 00:41:48.322
Stop him.

00:41:48.322 --> 00:41:49.322
Move!

00:41:53.493 --> 00:41:54.661
Were you aware of this?

00:41:55.579 --> 00:41:56.579
Of course not.

00:41:57.164 --> 00:41:58.164
What's your problem?

00:41:58.874 --> 00:42:00.458
Why was I kicked out of the top ten?

00:42:00.459 --> 00:42:01.459
Huh?

00:42:02.252 --> 00:42:03.962
Why do you think so?

00:42:07.257 --> 00:42:08.297
Can you stop the bullshit?

00:42:08.425 --> 00:42:11.303
I don't have time for this.

00:42:12.304 --> 00:42:14.765
Were you involved in my demotion?

00:42:15.641 --> 00:42:16.641
You know what, Luke

00:42:18.560 --> 00:42:21.647
this is the very reason why you
were demoted from the top ten.

00:42:22.439 --> 00:42:25.025
You're too hot tempered.

00:42:25.484 --> 00:42:26.610
For once,

00:42:27.402 --> 00:42:28.195
calm down

00:42:28.196 --> 00:42:30.196
and try reflecting on
your fucking actions

00:42:30.197 --> 00:42:31.782
instead of blaming it
on someone else.

00:42:32.574 --> 00:42:33.574
Says who?

00:42:35.035 --> 00:42:37.913
You are becoming a liablity to the gang.

00:42:38.538 --> 00:42:39.538
So if I were you

00:42:40.540 --> 00:42:41.541
straighten up.

00:42:42.668 --> 00:42:44.169
If you still want to be in this gang.

00:43:05.227 --> 00:43:06.227
Good job, man.

00:43:06.441 --> 00:43:07.944
We're in the top ten!

00:43:11.493 --> 00:43:12.493
What is it?

00:43:12.754 --> 00:43:13.754
Are you okay?

00:43:14.389 --> 00:43:16.157
There's something you
guys aren't telling us.

00:43:17.202 --> 00:43:18.202
Huh?

00:43:21.266 --> 00:43:22.391
Matt

00:43:22.416 --> 00:43:23.417
tell us the truth.

00:43:24.001 --> 00:43:25.418
Did you and Jerome

00:43:25.419 --> 00:43:27.963
join one of the gangs
here in Hell University?

00:43:28.212 --> 00:43:29.212
What?

00:43:29.706 --> 00:43:30.832
Are you serious, Van?

00:43:31.939 --> 00:43:32.792
Yeah, right.

00:43:32.817 --> 00:43:34.067
That's nonsense.

00:43:34.845 --> 00:43:35.845
Okay.

00:43:36.471 --> 00:43:37.471
How about this...

00:43:38.765 --> 00:43:40.934
how did you guys end
up in the top ten?

00:43:41.393 --> 00:43:42.393
And you?

00:43:42.728 --> 00:43:44.771
King of Hell University, really?

00:43:46.064 --> 00:43:47.482
Is Vanessa telling the truth?

00:43:47.639 --> 00:43:48.639
That's not true!

00:43:48.853 --> 00:43:50.313
Why would we join the gangs?

00:43:50.736 --> 00:43:51.653
Maybe you're forgetting

00:43:51.685 --> 00:43:53.560
how many times they've
tried to kill us.

00:43:53.655 --> 00:43:54.114
Right?

00:43:54.114 --> 00:43:55.114
Exactly.

00:43:55.240 --> 00:43:58.493
And if we really did join BBG or DGW

00:43:58.702 --> 00:44:00.202
shouldn't we be dead by now?

00:44:00.203 --> 00:44:01.203
Exactly.

00:44:03.165 --> 00:44:05.709
So how did you manage
to join the top ten?

00:44:06.835 --> 00:44:08.628
Our grades are high.

00:44:09.588 --> 00:44:09.963
Right?

00:44:09.964 --> 00:44:11.423
This is still a school after all.

00:44:11.882 --> 00:44:13.550
And can we please just focus on Zein.

00:44:13.759 --> 00:44:14.926
She needs us.

00:44:16.386 --> 00:44:17.511
I really hope you're telling the truth.

00:44:17.512 --> 00:44:18.512
Stop this.

00:44:18.597 --> 00:44:20.349
Guys, let's talk about
it some other time.

00:44:21.058 --> 00:44:22.351
We should go to Zein.

00:44:22.809 --> 00:44:23.809
I agree.

00:44:24.186 --> 00:44:25.395
Let's go.

00:44:26.355 --> 00:44:26.980
Zein.

00:44:27.314 --> 00:44:28.314
Let's go.

00:45:18.323 --> 00:45:19.324
Supremo…

00:45:20.492 --> 00:45:21.492
You're awake!

00:45:23.036 --> 00:45:24.454
What happened to me?

00:45:25.789 --> 00:45:26.248
I thought...

00:45:26.498 --> 00:45:27.498
No...

00:45:30.043 --> 00:45:31.043
I'm sorry.

00:45:32.170 --> 00:45:33.839
They targeted you because of me.

00:45:36.133 --> 00:45:37.175
You scared me.

00:45:38.885 --> 00:45:40.345
I thought I was going to lose you.

00:45:42.222 --> 00:45:43.890
Are you sure you're okay?

00:45:45.600 --> 00:45:46.643
You're all better now?

00:45:48.603 --> 00:45:49.980
As long as you're okay.

00:45:50.772 --> 00:45:51.772
I'm fine.

00:45:56.403 --> 00:45:57.487
Supremo

00:45:59.281 --> 00:46:01.783
why do you look so handsome?

00:46:05.287 --> 00:46:06.287
Really?

00:46:11.042 --> 00:46:12.377
I thought that

00:46:13.336 --> 00:46:15.136
Matthew is the only
handsome one in your eyes.

00:46:17.048 --> 00:46:19.634
You look different now.

00:46:23.138 --> 00:46:24.347
I admit it, Zein.

00:46:27.642 --> 00:46:29.978
I’m not the noblest man
to walk this place.

00:46:33.064 --> 00:46:34.264
I've done a lot of bad things.

00:46:37.027 --> 00:46:39.112
I know I have blood on my hands

00:46:40.489 --> 00:46:41.781
that I can never wash off.

00:46:43.867 --> 00:46:44.867
And I'm not proud of it.

00:46:46.661 --> 00:46:47.829
But when it comes to you.

00:46:51.166 --> 00:46:52.459
I won't have second thoughts.

00:46:54.211 --> 00:46:55.837
So I will leave you a promise…

00:46:58.757 --> 00:47:00.175
I will keep you safe.

00:47:01.301 --> 00:47:02.302
No matter what.

00:47:04.221 --> 00:47:05.221
But

00:47:06.473 --> 00:47:08.350
we're here in Hell University.

00:47:09.267 --> 00:47:10.769
Nothing here is safe.

00:47:14.231 --> 00:47:15.524
Well there's actually one.

00:47:18.652 --> 00:47:19.652
Where?

00:47:21.863 --> 00:47:22.863
Not where…

00:47:26.076 --> 00:47:27.536
As long as I'm breathing

00:47:29.329 --> 00:47:30.329
you're safe.

00:47:37.546 --> 00:47:38.546
I

00:47:39.589 --> 00:47:40.674
Ace Craige

00:47:43.009 --> 00:47:44.219
will be your shield

00:47:47.389 --> 00:47:48.848
your bulletproof vest

00:47:50.725 --> 00:47:51.851
and your knight.

00:47:53.478 --> 00:47:54.813
Why do you look unhappy?

00:47:56.565 --> 00:47:57.649
I'm happy

00:47:59.150 --> 00:48:00.150
but

00:48:03.446 --> 00:48:04.656
what did you do?

00:48:11.538 --> 00:48:12.706
Do you trust me?

00:48:15.875 --> 00:48:17.961
What did you do?

00:49:26.488 --> 00:49:27.781
Impossible…

00:49:41.294 --> 00:49:43.129
Roxanne isn't the
queen of HU anymore.

00:49:44.339 --> 00:49:45.339
It's you...

00:49:45.715 --> 00:49:46.715
Zein.

00:49:46.841 --> 00:49:49.469
It's crucial that Supremo
isn't involved with anyone.

00:49:49.636 --> 00:49:52.639
The President must not show
any signs of weakness.

00:49:52.907 --> 00:49:54.741
I'm curious of the people's reactions

00:49:54.766 --> 00:49:57.936
once they find out Supremo's favoritism.

00:49:57.936 --> 00:49:58.936
MkvDrama.net